<!doctype lake><title>🐘 𝓐𝓵𝓲𝓰𝓷𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="TK1Rj" id="TK1Rj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u260aaa7a" id="u260aaa7a">🔮</span><span data-lake-id="uc3d0ed0a" id="uc3d0ed0a"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u38fed830" id="u38fed830">𝐌𝐨𝐧𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐢c 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐭 𝐑𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u50eb5fdb" id="u50eb5fdb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7318ad55" id="u7318ad55">指令微调训练模型遵循以自然语言描述的任务指令，使其能够较好地泛化至此前未见过的任务。然而，尽管模型具备遵循指令的能力，仍可能生成有害或不符合伦理规范的内容</span></strong></p><ul list="u4f1dc710"><li fid="u0f7db0dc" data-lake-id="ue47abd81" id="ue47abd81"><span data-lake-id="u9220ab13" id="u9220ab13">为使这些模型进一步与人类价值观对齐，需要利用成对偏好数据进行额外训练，例如采用基于人类反馈的强化学习或直接偏好优化</span></li><li fid="u0f7db0dc" data-lake-id="u15c67f70" id="u15c67f70"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1146dbf4" id="u1146dbf4" style="color: #663000">现有偏好对齐方法通常采用多阶段训练流程，需要额外的参考模型以及独立的监督微调预热阶段，从而带来额外的资源开销</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1088691b" id="u1088691b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c6dad54" id="u1c6dad54" style="color: #DF2A3F">作者提出一种新的对齐方法——优势比偏好优化（Odds Ratio Preference Optimization，ORPO）。该方法在 SFT 过程中引入惩罚项，引导模型避免学习不期望的生成风格。相较于既有方法，ORPO 具有以下改进</span></strong></p><ul list="u15164af2"><li fid="ud95e2497" data-lake-id="u7a1ad1a1" id="u7a1ad1a1"><span data-lake-id="u94463e3e" id="u94463e3e">既不需要参考模型，也不需要独立的 SFT 阶段；实际训练中的计算量不足既有方法的一半</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud370436c" id="ud370436c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1754315480548-082a7bc5-a61b-4a9f-bd8e-6eace718b134.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u19dca521-7a44-4c5b-8f8b-9472ca4036f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u64ac1bcd-2c73-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A864.8125%2C%22height%22%3A279%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A93825%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1240%2C%22originHeight%22%3A400%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ODDSRATIOPREFERENCEQPTIMIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A806%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A340%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINEDMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRE-TRAINEDLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFERENCEMOD%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A234%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%97%A8I%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ODDSEPGIW%22%2C%22x%22%3A1066%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REJECTEDRESPON%22%2C%22x%22%3A736%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EFERENCEMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINEDMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A534%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINEDMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A309%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ODDSEPYNW%22%2C%22x%22%3A1065%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALIGNEDLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A319%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOAKPENA%22%2C%22x%22%3A919%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RLHF%22%2C%22x%22%3A95%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REWARDMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A280%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SFT%22%2C%22x%22%3A95%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222UAPTAIO%22%2C%22x%22%3A944%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A346%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A570%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SFT%22%2C%22x%22%3A340%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210G%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1030%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHOSENRESP%22%2C%22x%22%3A750%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FRONG%22%2C%22x%22%3A912%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23edebe9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u85f0e16e%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="IKJIj" id="IKJIj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7a1a7627" id="u7a1a7627">🐉</span><span data-lake-id="ubccb2164" id="ubccb2164"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e4d6639" id="u7e4d6639">𝐎𝐝𝐝𝐬 𝐑𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="u475d1941" id="u475d1941"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua69ff9a9" id="ua69ff9a9" style="color: #AD1A2B">ORPO 在传统监督微调损失，即负对数似然损失中，引入基于优势比的惩罚项，以区分偏好回答与非偏好回答的生成风格</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u61c82387" id="u61c82387"><span data-lake-id="u6fdd2204" id="u6fdd2204">给定语言模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V1MCs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u242302c3" id="u242302c3">和输入序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lJTaY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f58869c" id="u9f58869c">，模型生成输出序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uSImm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua36a69a0" id="ua36a69a0">的平均对数似然计算如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue712ec42" id="ue712ec42" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20P_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_t%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7B%3Ct%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90fc09fd7278da25924a965cde84f7ea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N9Wmx%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0c647b48" id="u0c647b48" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BP_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B1-P_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb42c8ec74a4023bfb3a1eccb7d17613.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UwyPY%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5c0fbe31" id="u5c0fbe31"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8f17508" id="ub8f17508">根据偏好回答与非偏好回答这两类结果的似然，使用几率对偏好进行建模。这一设计旨在刻画偏好的二元性，而优势比正适用于此类情形</span></strong></p><ul list="uc8f38d52"><li fid="ude858f38" data-lake-id="u9bad453f" id="u9bad453f"><span data-lake-id="u213e79d0" id="u213e79d0">直观而言，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3Dk%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c03e57d31f8834a030dce1ef1f69933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GN8kz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e221dca" id="u9e221dca">表示，模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g4FY1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2acc2fe1" id="u2acc2fe1">生成输出序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d7d9L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udfde4fed" id="udfde4fed">的可能性是不生成该序列的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fzfLS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea9948d0" id="uea9948d0">倍。因此，偏好回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d3748a1a6b1a91dda986e0b204471a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L8ivJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ce6ef7d" id="u6ce6ef7d">相对于非偏好回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5940c70497dd7c00369aa6f50b3cc63b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pQszj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5db82b1" id="ue5db82b1">的优势比定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0116ded1" id="u0116ded1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BOR%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e2e94b761ae8b920733422e1ded8040.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kWSyx%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u78dca390" id="u78dca390"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaabee4d3" id="uaabee4d3">RLHF 方法通常利用 SFT 来确保当前策略能够稳定更新，并将 SFT 模型用作参考策略。即使在不采用强化学习的对齐方法中，SFT 对于使模型收敛至预期结果至关重要。具体而言，SFT 使用交叉熵损失，在模型对参考答案预测的 logits 较低时对其施加惩罚</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u47db5fc3" id="u47db5fc3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D)%3D-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bm%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%5C%5Clog%20P(x%5E%7B(k)%7D%2Cy%5E%7B(k)%7D).%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e8f140a3571984a063867c06efe65a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22igHRB%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u725bfaf0" id="u725bfaf0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D)%3D-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bm%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bk%3D1%7D%5E%7Bm%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7CV%7C%7Dy_i%5E%7B(k)%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cleft(p_i%5E%7B(k)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f394bfdea1a4cf33685097bab5b4f34.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lWLNo%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua1fdd548"><li fid="u05d6b386" data-lake-id="u8e4b45b7" id="u8e4b45b7"><span data-lake-id="u7fe87cca" id="u7fe87cca">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54507b6bac465d8afb0e218ccbf31b59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WwfEM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9929cfb1" id="u9929cfb1">为布尔值，用于指示词表</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UyPrq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9014b49f" id="u9014b49f">中的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SndRG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u887d29d6" id="u887d29d6">个 token 是否为标签 token；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39c69fbad0041c1d5caa9acf313cb0e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eFTLR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69ffbfd6" id="u69ffbfd6">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c37ng%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d72afde" id="u1d72afde">个 token 的概率；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hJQgT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua2624851" id="ua2624851">为序列长度。对于非答案 token，由于其对应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54507b6bac465d8afb0e218ccbf31b59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pUfXB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3aae6431" id="u3aae6431">被设为 0，交叉熵本身不会直接对其 logits 施加惩罚或激励</span></li><li fid="u05d6b386" data-lake-id="u6812ee72" id="u6812ee72"><span data-lake-id="ub9c00f53" id="ub9c00f53">尽管交叉熵通常能够有效实现领域适配，但它在强化偏好回答时，并不具备惩罚非偏好回答的机制。因此，非偏好回答中 token 的对数概率也会随着偏好回答一同上升。从偏好对齐的角度来看，这一现象并不理想</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u993cea80" id="u993cea80"><strong><span data-lake-id="u008b4e26" id="u008b4e26">惩罚不期望的生成内容。在损失中加入非似然惩罚，已被证明能够有效减少模型中不期望的退化生成行为。例如，为避免重复生成，可以针对先前上下文中的不期望 token 集合</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%5C%5Cin%20C_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brecent%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5f56a976c6086d58ee1e51161e838d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W2a3C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4ab1b4c" id="ub4ab1b4c">，在损失中加入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(1-p_i%5E%7B(k)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ebdecf6c2228d3df2b134b8d2f54b2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r2Ram%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9049998f" id="u9049998f">项，从而惩罚模型对近期出现的 token 赋予较高概率的行为</span></strong></p><ul list="ub07c2d63"><li fid="u9483d8ef" data-lake-id="u64c774ee" id="u64c774ee"><strong><span data-lake-id="u17ab195f" id="u17ab195f" style="color: #101E60">受到 SFT 会为非偏好 token 赋予较高概率这一现象，以及通过附加惩罚项抑制不期望生成行为的有效性的启发，作者设计一种一体化偏好对齐方法。该方法能够针对每个查询动态惩罚非偏好回答，而无需人工构造应被拒绝的 token 集合</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub2b9f93f" id="ub2b9f93f"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac1a2009" id="uac1a2009">对于三元组</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%3D(x%2Cy_l%2Cy_w)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F10d35daf2ae0cb050e6e5ce61e94c574.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dw48i%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u20856421" id="u20856421">，ORPO 的目标函数由两个部分组成：监督微调损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2bfcef764c0f0dacbe184297af930719.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sZffD%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua644c648" id="ua644c648">；优势比损失</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOR%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9ca086898ef3f012a1bb0392c0c1de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v5DUW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u66555cb8" id="u66555cb8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(d%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D(x%2Cy_w%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%2B%5C%5Clambda%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOR%7D%7D(d%3B%5C%5Ctheta).%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F381dbf81977a4f663cc29a15b3d98831.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D6aHK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0ae0eeec"><li fid="u5b96c7ed" data-lake-id="u33ef8fe5" id="u33ef8fe5"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2bfcef764c0f0dacbe184297af930719.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C43VJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53e90c7d" id="u53e90c7d">最大化参考 token 的生成似然，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOR%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9ca086898ef3f012a1bb0392c0c1de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l6ECj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u83f0cf62" id="u83f0cf62">则用于最大化偏好回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d3748a1a6b1a91dda986e0b204471a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tPOEN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u98fc24d7" id="u98fc24d7">相对于非偏好回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5940c70497dd7c00369aa6f50b3cc63b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SB2Vv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udafb1272" id="udafb1272">的生成优势比</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue302c117" id="ue302c117" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOR%7D%7D(d%3B%5C%5Ctheta)%3D-%5C%5Clog%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc2929810a12be97a76fd987a87a04cb8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cI70G%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u88e59ff3"><li fid="ud53faadd" data-lake-id="udd25b75a" id="udd25b75a"><span data-lake-id="u0e1c83f9" id="u0e1c83f9">通过使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jT1kf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a09fdbc" id="u3a09fdbc">对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOR%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9ca086898ef3f012a1bb0392c0c1de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hCMl8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e7747da" id="u0e7747da">项进行加权，可以使预训练语言模型适应目标领域中的特定子集，同时抑制其生成非偏好回答集合中的内容</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub9ec667d" id="ub9ec667d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790740518979-791c71a3-676c-4de7-97a6-d4109ff07e8a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0977fce5-a274-4c96-b351-1d9c83657ec%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u62f6363c-cd3b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A875.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A312%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A308603%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1239%2C%22originHeight%22%3A441%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TORCH.LOGLP(-TORCH.EXP(POLICYCHOSEN_LOGPS))-TORCH.LOGLO(-TORCH%2CEXP(POLICYREJECTEDLOGPS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A81%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A1083%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ETUNNLOSSES%2CCHOSENREWARDS%2CREJECTEDREWARDS%2CTORCH.MEAN(RATIO)%2CTORCH.MEAN(LOGODDS)%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A1009%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOSENREWARDS%3DSELF.BETA*(POLICYCHOSEN_LOGPS.TO(SELF.ACELERATOR.DEVICE)).DETACH()%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A991%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EJECTEDREWARDS%3DSELF.BETA*(POLICY_REJECTEDLOGPS.TO(SELF.ACELERATOR.DEVICE).DETACH()%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A375%2C%22width%22%3A1029%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)TUPLETORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATENSOR%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A1163%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OGODDS%3D(POLICYCHOSENLOGPS-POLICY_REJECTED_LOGPS)-(%22%2C%22x%22%3A65%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A842%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O1ICY_CHOSEN_1OGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A439%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PO1ICY_REJECTED_LOGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A108%2C%22width%22%3A469%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RATIO%3DF.LOGSIGMOID(1OG_ODDS%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A257%2C%22width%22%3A336%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EFODDS_RATIOLOSS(%22%2C%22x%22%3A22%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A219%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOSSES%3DSE1F.BETA*RATI%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A287%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SELF%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8ef%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u13102922%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7fcb31a7" id="u7fcb31a7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub044b662" id="ub044b662">梯度分析：对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOR%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9ca086898ef3f012a1bb0392c0c1de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yo7rV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6cf9892e" id="u6cf9892e">梯度的分析为采用优势比损失提供依据。该梯度可表示为两个部分的乘积</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue83c10d7" id="ue83c10d7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOR%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cdelta(d)%5C%5Ccdot%20h(d).%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa9647517807c617e28db0bffd560a596.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YHE6n%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u27bb404e"><li fid="u954a76ba" data-lake-id="ue5fb51df" id="ue5fb51df"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta(d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb9e122161ec551bf1eb4490744e5ca6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wpam6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17ebc94e" id="u17ebc94e">对模型的错误预测施加惩罚，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h(d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d61ae181d73349e7d6409bcb6967450.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZP5oZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1760f70b" id="u1760f70b">则对偏好回答与非偏好回答进行对比</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u49276364" id="u49276364" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta(d)%3D%5C%5Cleft%5B1%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7DP(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bodds%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7DP(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc2c4d455bccd56a8d291340ed9859926.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hvUIV%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud319dc23" id="ud319dc23" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h(d)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%20P_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B1-P_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Clog%20P_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B1-P_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53dde556cc8845f373c54cb029bd0d3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ay1lS%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub6264fab"><li fid="u2815c6d9" data-lake-id="u404b39bb" id="u404b39bb"><span data-lake-id="ua286673f" id="ua286673f">当偏好回答的几率相对于非偏好回答更高时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta(d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb9e122161ec551bf1eb4490744e5ca6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fKIE8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2738e731" id="u2738e731">将趋近于 0。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta(d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb9e122161ec551bf1eb4490744e5ca6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uaNlD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb5a002a" id="ufb5a002a">发挥着惩罚项的作用：当模型更倾向于生成非偏好回答时，它会加快参数更新</span></li><li fid="u2815c6d9" data-lake-id="u50bb1b3a" id="u50bb1b3a"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h(d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d61ae181d73349e7d6409bcb6967450.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PfzcA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u86d27892" id="u86d27892">表示偏好回答与非偏好回答对应梯度之间的加权对比。具体而言，当某一侧的似然</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d594d576516a6ddca13b78cc849690f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ff9od%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50551078" id="u50551078">较高时，分母中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-P(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b0a7cd537ef4cabffda42444383bfc0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MINbk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35d594b6" id="u35d594b6">会放大该侧的梯度。对于偏好回答，随着其似然增大，这一机制将加快模型向偏好回答分布的适配</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="cKmSP" id="cKmSP" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uffbb6330" id="uffbb6330">🧚</span><span data-lake-id="ub985b768" id="ub985b768"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b0a36b8" id="u1b0a36b8">𝐊𝐓𝐎 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐀𝐥𝐢𝐠𝐧𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐚𝐬 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐭 𝐓𝐡𝐞𝐨𝐫𝐞𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u01844ac8" id="u01844ac8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc741855a" id="uc741855a">利用人类反馈对生成模型进行对齐，已被成功用于提升生成内容的有用性、事实准确性和伦理合规性等方面的表现</span></strong></p><ul list="ud12a5ae9"><li fid="u201b6fa0" data-lake-id="u37685081" id="u37685081"><span data-lake-id="u931d3687" id="u931d3687">RLHF 和 DPO 等对齐方法已被反复证明优于仅进行监督微调。然而，尽管人类反馈可以采取多种形式，例如针对给定输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AzEix%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e76990f" id="u3e76990f">，对输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KygvN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued5d6eed" id="ued5d6eed">表示认可或不认可，现有讨论却往往仅关注偏好形式的反馈，例如对于输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QROdX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16eb3d92" id="u16eb3d92">，输出之间存在偏好关系</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%5C%5Csucc%20y_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F82ca79d9257a7ebf3c4f38fc4d3b7296.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pZhrU%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u201b6fa0" data-lake-id="u3ca92b86" id="u3ca92b86"><span data-lake-id="u96b160df" id="u96b160df">尽管偏好数据在实践中相对稀缺且采集成本较高，目前被证明效果最好的对齐方法——RLHF和 DPO，都依赖此类数据</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u48a37110" id="u48a37110"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc693f2a4" id="uc693f2a4">作者从前景理论的视角重新审视模型对齐。前景理论解释人类在面对不确定事件时，为何会作出不以期望值最大化为目标的决策。该理论以形式化方式刻画人类如何以存在偏差但具有明确规律的方式感知随机变量</span></strong></p><ul list="ufda93485"><li fid="u1e27d12d" data-lake-id="u0a9cad3e" id="u0a9cad3e"><span data-lake-id="u553188a0" id="u553188a0">相对于某个参考点，人类对损失的敏感程度高于对收益的敏感程度，这一特性被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c52fbd1" id="u6c52fbd1">损失厌恶（loss aversion）</span></strong></li><li fid="u1e27d12d" data-lake-id="ua8eb9e82" id="ua8eb9e82"><span data-lake-id="uecad7d68" id="uecad7d68">DPO 和 PPO-Clip 等常用对齐方法隐式地建模其中的一些偏差，从而能够从所用数据之外的角度解释这些方法的有效性。在此基础上，提出一类更一般的损失函数，称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua6715d83" id="ua6715d83">人类感知损失（human-aware losses，HALOs）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3a6d2829" id="u3a6d2829">​</span></li><li fid="u1e27d12d" data-lake-id="u75054b7a" id="u75054b7a"><span data-lake-id="u11407782" id="u11407782">尽管无法一概断言 HALOs 必然优于非 HALO 损失，在现有方法中，符合 HALO 定义的方法通常比不符合该定义的方法表现更好</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5682b216" id="u5682b216"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d2b25c6" id="u6d2b25c6">为采用更具理论依据的方法，作者利用 Kahneman 和 Tversky 提出的人类效用模型，推导出一种 HALO。该效用模型最初用于描述人类如何针对不确定的金钱收益结果作出决策</span></strong></p><ul list="uac932131"><li fid="ud5100c94" data-lake-id="u3b38b623" id="u3b38b623"><span data-lake-id="u392a5b3b" id="u392a5b3b">将这一方法称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue474ab25" id="ue474ab25">卡尼曼—特沃斯基优化（Kahneman-Tversky Optimization，KTO）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5e72e1e6" id="u5e72e1e6">。与当前大多数方法最大化偏好的对数似然不同，KTO 直接最大化生成结果的效用。KTO 仅需要一个二元信号，用于指示给定输入下的某个输出是否符合期望</span></li><li fid="ud5100c94" data-lake-id="u83b7da28" id="u83b7da28"><span data-lake-id="u20950e98" id="u20950e98">KTO 的设计初衷是：即使模型只能从较弱的监督信号中学习，也可以通过实际应用中能够获取的更大规模数据来弥补</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="uwisf" id="uwisf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3a77da67" id="u3a77da67">🎨</span><span data-lake-id="ucdcc62d4" id="ucdcc62d4"> 𝐀 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐭 𝐓𝐡𝐞𝐨𝐫𝐞𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐕𝐢𝐞𝐰 𝐨𝐟 𝐀𝐥𝐢𝐠𝐧𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u6a3004bc" id="u6a3004bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u35401fd7" id="u35401fd7" style="color: #AE146E">前景理论视角下的模型对齐：前景理论解释人类在面对不确定事件时，为何会作出不以期望值最大化为目标的决策。在前景理论中，人类效用取决于价值函数和权重函数</span></strong></p><ul list="u7a2b8a6b"><li fid="ud7faf2a1" data-lake-id="uc3411e5b" id="uc3411e5b"><span data-lake-id="u1fcf22be" id="u1fcf22be">价值函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%3A%5C%5Cmathcal%7BZ%7D%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d0b55bc1dfee259046f2f23937031e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jQ6DQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb5b1ed8" id="udb5b1ed8">将结果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YTGlj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u668f2464" id="u668f2464">相对于某个参考点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cYns5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5162a266" id="u5162a266">的变化映射为其感知价值，即主观价值。例如，这类函数能够刻画以下现象：相比于同等幅度的相对收益，人类通常对相对损失更加敏感</span></li><li fid="ud7faf2a1" data-lake-id="u0d93dcc2" id="u0d93dcc2"><span data-lake-id="u027ada90" id="u027ada90">权重函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F327cab7c761f03df97ad9c71506d0589.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jNM54%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u22796bd9" id="u22796bd9">是容量函数的导数，该容量函数将累积概率映射为感知到的累积概率。记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega_z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faea53a5456aa6245ba0fb7c2d497c047.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SvIHE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua358be58" id="ua358be58">为赋予结果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j405f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa695874" id="uaa695874">的权重。</span></li><li fid="ud7faf2a1" data-lake-id="ub40a8016" id="ub40a8016"><span data-lake-id="u03d38885" id="u03d38885">随机变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca9972fb0e732f9a939604a4b2e0f4c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MaqQw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0304d875" id="u0304d875">的效用是其各个可能结果的函数：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22u(Z)%5C%5Ctriangleq%5C%5Csum_%7Bz%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathcal%7BZ%7D%7D%5C%5Comega_zv(z-z_0).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F554c956ac22919c7ee0daf057c4fbdd3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ety1L%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue79b1110" id="ue79b1110">Tversky 和 Kahneman 通过向受试者提供涉及金钱的赌博方案，并询问其确定性等价额，提出以下人类价值函数形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8f72d10b" id="u8f72d10b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v(z%3B%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Calpha%2Cz_0)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D(z-z_0)%5E%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%2C%26z%5C%5Cge%20z_0%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C-%5C%5Clambda(z_0-z)%5E%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%2C%26z%3Cz_0.%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8c80239adaec5de5449147fed2e8c5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iOAxG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u31ce8e21"><li fid="ueb5fb8b7" data-lake-id="ufd254d83" id="ufd254d83"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18d25ca4f77a9bbed9812e2bb0b350a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ux3Tm%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d942aeb" id="u6d942aeb" style="color: #270070">控制函数的曲率，反映风险厌恶程度；</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BiLzz%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue9fe6c84" id="ue9fe6c84" style="color: #270070">控制函数的陡峭程度，反映损失厌恶程度。价值函数的主要特征包括：存在一个用于确定相对收益或损失的参考点；在相对收益区间内具有凹性，即随着结果远离参考点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vy0Vz%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9db8868" id="uf9db8868" style="color: #270070">，敏感性逐渐降低；以及具有损失厌恶特性，即对损失更加敏感</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u70fc5063" id="u70fc5063"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cf4222c" id="u3cf4222c">HALOs 是能够体现 Tversky 和 Kahneman 所提出的人类决策模型的一类损失函数。设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sv340%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7bb981cf" id="u7bb981cf">表示待对齐模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%3A%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathcal%7BP%7D(%5C%5Cmathcal%7BY%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5cbca2ad1c1771d2ad54960d33211079.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OoaQ0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u69fba6d1" id="u69fba6d1">的可训练参数，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dnV7o%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u755fe902" id="u755fe902">为参考模型，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%3A%5C%5Cmathcal%7BY%7D%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe8aadff829376e89ce286f4e15c76bff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZhSHT%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf16f716" id="ubf16f716">为归一化因子，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cy)%3Dl(y)%5C%5Clog%5B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%2F%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5a1ffe5534e3a33d6b8140eca6f7a121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UP6AX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3be1959c" id="u3be1959c"> 为隐含奖励</span></strong></p><ul list="u3fd41dcf"><li fid="u5c1d3d30" data-lake-id="ub814c768" id="ub814c768"><span data-lake-id="u7a71408d" id="u7a71408d">对于函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%3A%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cmathcal%7BY%7D%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff3ecd5509b29740f60563cab0353e822.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y7o4j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubcc514e8" id="ubcc514e8">，若存在定义在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cmathcal%7BY%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f2a11ca61712a96986f64c628f763a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ILtVp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69f0a5a0" id="u69f0a5a0">上的参考点分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(X'%2CY'%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32a029ade411e7086eacf8cf7a2d42aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b8npY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac60419f" id="uac60419f">，以及一个处处单调不减、在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(0%2C%5C%5Cinfty)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb4a2d26762145a9f74a369c8e81ee6e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zfl0j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3021f114" id="u3021f114">上为凹函数的价值函数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_f%3A%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7fa6ed5af1513e69f539c9a00c82cce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hs4x6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc654f15e" id="uc654f15e">，使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k7LXw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9db1b893" id="u9db1b893">是下述量的线性函数，则称</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dqgpI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u178a02a1" id="u178a02a1">为人类感知损失</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u64f330f9" id="u64f330f9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_f%5C%5Cleft(r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cy)-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7BQ%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Br_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x'%2Cy')%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f48d9db6758d2987f2ff5545262007b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22scSQj%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u426216e5"><li fid="u4f95fc61" data-lake-id="ud87626fb" id="ud87626fb"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd665debbffbbcb4849372ad62bc6b0eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ho4mt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09c34750" id="u09c34750">以 nat 为单位，表示从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RqIb0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88899713" id="u88899713">转变为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j5uy5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4193782c" id="u4193782c">时，经过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DvTVq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue50d456f" id="ue50d456f">归一化的条件自信息量的减少量。定义来源于大语言模型预训练和微调所采用的下一 token 预测目标。随着</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D8Z8j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ccef54d" id="u6ccef54d">逐步完成对齐，符合期望的输出所对应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd665debbffbbcb4849372ad62bc6b0eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iXKWB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce63f1f9" id="uce63f1f9">越来越趋向正值，而不符合期望的输出所对应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd665debbffbbcb4849372ad62bc6b0eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X2LXs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uec6975d6" id="uec6975d6">越来越趋向负值</span></li><li fid="u4f95fc61" data-lake-id="ucdb9eca9" id="ucdb9eca9"><span data-lake-id="ua513d7f5" id="ua513d7f5">HALO 中的参考点是从人类视角出发的期望奖励，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(X'%2CY'%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32a029ade411e7086eacf8cf7a2d42aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UAI2G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41259064" id="u41259064">描述被视为基线的样本。要求价值函数在收益区间内为凹函数，但不要求它在损失区间内一定为凸函数。这与经典的 Kahneman–Tversky 价值函数有所不同，因为少数个体在收益和损失两种情形下都表现出风险厌恶，从而使价值函数在整个定义域上均呈凹性</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="fubFR" id="fubFR" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uada58860" id="uada58860">🍎</span><span data-lake-id="u5d04a7cc" id="u5d04a7cc"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uabfdc713" id="uabfdc713">𝐊𝐚𝐡𝐧𝐞𝐦𝐚𝐧-𝐓𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐬𝐤𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="ub09b4063" id="ub09b4063"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8200d343" id="u8200d343">作者基于 Kahneman–Tversky 人类效用模型推导出一种 HALO，从而直接优化生成结果的效用，而非最大化偏好的对数似然</span></strong></p><ul list="ued950c6d"><li fid="ucf9d71b4" data-lake-id="u04b0f92b" id="u04b0f92b"><span data-lake-id="uc31d0b5a" id="uc31d0b5a">由于幂指数的作用，式（4）中的经典 Kahneman–Tversky 价值函数在优化过程中存在数值不稳定问题。因此，作者使用逻辑斯蒂函数替代该函数</span></li><li fid="ucf9d71b4" data-lake-id="u449aaa23" id="u449aaa23"><span data-lake-id="u216a6b71" id="u216a6b71">为控制风险厌恶程度，引入超参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dfdd2a0bf441fb1830411dc37f32d49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22owgiV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04742dd4" id="u04742dd4">，并将其作为价值函数的一部分。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m3HXn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ccfa7ef" id="u1ccfa7ef">越大，价值函数越快趋于饱和，这意味着人类在收益情形下更加厌恶风险，同时在损失情形下更加倾向于风险寻求</span></li><li fid="ucf9d71b4" data-lake-id="u0e9f2abe" id="u0e9f2abe"><span data-lake-id="uc7b9613e" id="uc7b9613e">将原始 Kahneman–Tversky 价值函数中的损失厌恶系数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fz8oA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5954257d" id="u5954257d">替换为权重函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%3A%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cmathcal%7BY%7D%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4bcb0611d7f5549de6d0ba586fec573d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tf9cr%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ucf9d71b4" data-lake-id="uda4733b0" id="uda4733b0"><span data-lake-id="ucdf3e0e5" id="ucdf3e0e5">默认情况下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w(x%2Cy)%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Clambda_D%2C%5C%5Clambda_U%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F622f3ad17cc27ee6c011d81a6098e481.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gWXbl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf6b58349" id="uf6b58349">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e0d077c9735b28557ff0520a4985ca6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mVBqw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1501ebb" id="ua1501ebb">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_U%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ab4bdac60b9c99c5644ab5be1e2ed49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JOcpc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u536f23db" id="u536f23db">分别是用于控制符合期望与不符合期望样本对应损失的超参数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uae0881ff" id="uae0881ff"><strong><span data-lake-id="u885071e7" id="u885071e7">不再仅使用一个非偏好生成结果作为参考点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R9nHS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud266fe8f" id="ud266fe8f">，而是假设人类会相对于所有可能的输入—输出对来判断</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x%2Cy)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa969cab25db24b7b40ddd3064d3ab658.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GUmXP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u107b5de6" id="u107b5de6">的质量。将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(X'%2CY'%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32a029ade411e7086eacf8cf7a2d42aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lUt4X%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf07cffe7" id="uf07cffe7">分解为数据集输入上的均匀先验，以及条件分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(Y'%5C%5Cmid%20X')%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9a954210ff34432ecf7aabfa588a045.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QqQU7%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8aa45c93" id="u8aa45c93">，并令后者为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jk4kM%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u011c4559" id="u011c4559">。参考点可简化为 KL 散度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKL%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y'%5C%5Cmid%20x')%5C%5CVert%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y'%5C%5Cmid%20x'))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb12bf7e5f4d5305cd18bbcf4f9934495.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tdTHm%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa8d9fa0" id="uaa8d9fa0">关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(X')%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5758d4fb7933a7514c9d02865cee3eed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kJ4xo%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud594fac4" id="ud594fac4">的期望</span></strong></p><ul list="ubcd647cd"><li fid="u2a5c0384" data-lake-id="u75478d6e" id="u75478d6e"><span data-lake-id="u0fdc1683" id="u0fdc1683">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wzBj0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u10fd28c2" id="u10fd28c2">符合期望时，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_y%3D%5C%5Clambda_D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa12e9aad9431061f07a262a3adff9e59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VuPOQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1b9921d1" id="u1b9921d1">；当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qy4G6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18b14331" id="u18b14331">不符合期望时，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_y%3D%5C%5Clambda_U%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32714f2857d7a6c6587c824d960b6722.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wFk3b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44364402" id="u44364402">。默认的 KTO 损失为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uda6fb575" id="uda6fb575" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKTO%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%2Cy%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clambda_y-v(x%2Cy)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F640f8e8e761816e031854aea557e99b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r2Qom%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud85da82d"><li fid="uc51abb3a" data-lake-id="ud5e246a4" id="ud5e246a4"><span data-lake-id="ude2ba864" id="ude2ba864">其中，隐含奖励为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa0e0fcbc37befb108ed6e73cc9ff9092.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jXATf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4dc49eef" id="u4dc49eef">，参考点为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uad2b3ccb" id="uad2b3ccb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx'%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKL%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y'%5C%5Cmid%20x')%5C%5CVert%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y'%5C%5Cmid%20x')%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b4aedddba53b89b1a417dc8f9a35dfd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gsway%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0eca08b0"><li fid="u513aadb2" data-lake-id="uc8b4a374" id="uc8b4a374"><span data-lake-id="ub3ec6b28" id="ub3ec6b28">价值函数为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0455527f" id="u0455527f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Clambda_D%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta(r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cy)-z_0)%5C%5Cright)%2C%26y%5C%5Csim%20y_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdesirable%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Clambda_U%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta(z_0-r_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x%2Cy))%5C%5Cright)%2C%26y%5C%5Csim%20y_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bundesirable%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x.%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F741fdced749f3dc4bfacff70b70f1708.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P6jeJ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufbbdf785"><li fid="uef73d25e" data-lake-id="u4892aa58" id="u4892aa58"><span data-lake-id="u163c3185" id="u163c3185">为提高训练稳定性，不通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v19dh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued3bc8f0" id="ued3bc8f0">进行反向传播；它的作用仅在于控制损失的饱和行为</span></li><li fid="uef73d25e" data-lake-id="u146aede6" id="u146aede6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u08f6014a" id="u08f6014a" style="color: #663000">KTO 的工作机制如下：如果模型只是简单地提高某个符合期望样本的奖励，那么 KL 惩罚也会随之增大，从而无法取得实质性进展。这迫使模型学习究竟是什么使一个输出符合期望，以便在提高奖励的同时，使 KL 项保持不变，甚至有所下降。在相反方向上也有类似的作用机制，不过，KL 项的非负性使价值函数在损失区间内能够更快地达到饱和</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uad434d6e" id="uad434d6e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c988ca8" id="u1c988ca8">在实践中，直接按照上述定义估计</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ea6hJ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6304fc73" id="u6304fc73">并不可行，因为从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nyPG2%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8008a149" id="u8008a149">中采样的速度较慢，而且人类也无法感知</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PxRpY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8df1df5" id="ua8df1df5">所诱导的完整分布</span></strong></p><ul list="u017172fa"><li fid="u761a9874" data-lake-id="u4d60dafb" id="u4d60dafb"><span data-lake-id="u0f863eee" id="u0f863eee">如果根据人类实际持有的信念来计算期望奖励，就会得到 KL 项的有偏估计。人类存在可得性启发式，会对自己已经提供过反馈的输出赋予过高的权重，而不论这些输出是否构成输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BneAz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uac444317" id="uac444317">的良好续写。为更好地模拟人类感知到的参考点，构造</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SuPOw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f51ac15" id="u4f51ac15">组样本对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x_i%2Cy_j)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99fd8ad1c7b4b2dbd7bc6c466076a592.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NTUCl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb24a3d6" id="ubb24a3d6">，其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31fee971c83cea982db74c1cea622fd7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J7Lhi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2d191f7" id="ub2d191f7">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5b13ed0ae41bee9defcf75f2efc5f060.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mgQmT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48a18b34" id="u48a18b34">来自同一个大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZFGNK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud62951aa" id="ud62951aa">的离线数据批次，但满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%5C%5Cne%20j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F45eba81dc3d73f62a9ef997c75f92ccb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rk1l6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u692b1e2f" id="u692b1e2f">。据此，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d975eb112252fb8cc06982e37929e50.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GvTcJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9ccf000" id="ub9ccf000">估计为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue5da2e8c" id="ue5da2e8c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bz%7D_0%3D%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(0%2C%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bm%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%5C%5Cne%20j%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_j%5C%5Cmid%20x_i)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y_j%5C%5Cmid%20x_i)%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb2bb98f4542e7c7025b04e8d0c55b15.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YN2QV%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1df0313e" id="u1df0313e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1755430204190-4c757aac-adfe-4c92-8a89-fc817b517269.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucb629f89-d7d1-43c0-b020-5c46d1e6147%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3dff9d1b-1029-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A903.2727272727273%2C%22height%22%3A561%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A164233%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1242%2C%22originHeight%22%3A772%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EJECTED_REWARDS%3DSELF.BETA*REJECTED_LOGRATIOS.DETACH()%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A552%2C%22width%22%3A667%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHOSENLOGRATIOS%3DPOLICYCHOSEN_LOGPS-REFERENCE_CHOSEN_LOGPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A373%2C%22width%22%3A726%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOSENLOSSES%3D1-F%2CSIGMOID(SELF.BETA*(CHOSEN_LOGRATIOS-KL))%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A745%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ETURNLOSSES%2CCHOSEN_REWARDS%2CREJECTED_REWARDS%2CK1%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A731%2C%22width%22%3A581%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EIECTEDLOSSES%3D1-F%2CSIGMOID(SELF%2CBETA*(KL-REJECTED_LOGRATIOS))%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A522%2C%22width%22%3A794%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(SELF.DESIRABLE_WEIGHT*CHOSENLOSSES%2CSELF.UNDESIRABLEWEIGHT*REJECTEDL%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A643%2C%22width%22%3A888%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHOSEN_REWARDS%3DSELF.BETA*CHOSEN_LOGRATIOS.DETACH()%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A435%2C%22width%22%3A623%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFERENCE_CHOSEN_LOGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A484%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TUPLE%5BTORCH.FLOATENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATENSOR%2CTORCH.FLOATTENSOR%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A945%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EJECTEDLOGRATIOS%3DPOLICY_REJECTEDLOGPS-REFERENCE_REJECTEDLOGPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A493%2C%22width%22%3A790%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFERENCE_REJECTED_LOGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A196%2C%22width%22%3A498%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KL%3D(POLICY_KL_LOGPS-REFERENCE_KL_LOGPS).MEAN().DETACH()%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A727%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KL%3DSELF.ACCELERATOR.GATHER_FOR_METRICS(KL).MEAN().CLAMP(MIN%3D)%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A727%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLICY_CHOSEN1OGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A447%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLICYREJECTEDLOGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A467%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFERENCE_KL_LOGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A549%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POLICYKL1OGPS%3ATORCH.FLOATTENSOR%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A457%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EFKTO1OSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221OSSES%3DTORCH.CAT(%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A613%2C%22width%22%3A221%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SE1F%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fefefe%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5064d213%22%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="iaFhR" id="iaFhR" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8195e6d6" id="u8195e6d6"> </span><span data-lake-id="u3a610c7e" id="u3a610c7e">🍃</span><span data-lake-id="u9d26d594" id="u9d26d594"> 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐏𝐎: 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐚 𝐑𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞-𝐅𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐑𝐞𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐝</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u5c29fbdd" id="u5c29fbdd"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub226330d" id="ub226330d">基于人类反馈的强化学习是一种广泛采用的语言模型微调方法，旨在实现有效的模型对齐。尽管经典的 RLHF 方法已取得显著成效，但其多阶段训练流程也带来优化上的挑战：首先需要训练奖励模型，随后再优化策略模型，以最大化该奖励</span></strong></p><ul list="udcee849d"><li fid="u0bd15575" data-lake-id="u18b95d63" id="u18b95d63"><span data-lake-id="u387d8474" id="u387d8474">研究者开始探索更为简洁的离线算法，直接偏好优化便是其中之一。DPO 对 RLHF 中的奖励函数进行重参数化，直接利用偏好数据学习策略模型，从而无需显式的奖励模型</span></li><li fid="u0bd15575" data-lake-id="u7aa5b987" id="u7aa5b987"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e0ef9f3" id="u9e0ef9f3" style="color: #5C0036">在 DPO 中，隐式奖励通过同一回答在当前策略模型与监督微调模型下的似然比的对数来构造。然而，这种奖励形式并未与用于指导生成过程的指标直接保持一致；后者可近似表示为策略模型生成回答的平均对数似然。作者推测，这种训练与推理之间的不一致可能导致次优性能</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf43538b9" id="uf43538b9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub72f85ee" id="ub72f85ee" style="color: #AD1A2B">本文提出 SimPO，一种简单而有效的离线偏好优化算法。该算法的核心在于，使偏好优化目标中的奖励函数与生成阶段所使用的指标保持一致</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucee504c6" id="ucee504c6">。SimPO 包含两个主要组成部分：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4f03c5e" id="uf4f03c5e" style="color: #663000">长度归一化奖励，即利用策略模型计算回答中所有 token 的平均对数概率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ueccef137" id="ueccef137">；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5d6dc92" id="ub5d6dc92" style="color: #270070">目标奖励间隔，用于确保偏好回答与非偏好回答之间的奖励差值超过该间隔</span></strong></p><ul list="u924ea00d"><li fid="ucef1f327" data-lake-id="ub8754d7d" id="ub8754d7d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93eb7de5" id="u93eb7de5">简洁性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0436b19c" id="u0436b19c">SimPO 无需参考模型，因此相较于 DPO 及其他依赖参考模型的方法，其更加轻量，也更易于实现。</span></li><li fid="ucef1f327" data-lake-id="ub2a90b63" id="ub2a90b63"><strong><span data-lake-id="u659d15c4" id="u659d15c4">较少利用长度偏置：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2fe7618c" id="u2fe7618c">与 SFT 或 DPO 模型相比，SimPO 并未显著增加回答长度，表明其较少通过利用长度偏置获得性能提升</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6c7f6cca" id="u6c7f6cca" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1755431972568-baeb92a4-c2b0-454f-bbc9-31a548bf512a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u397ab043-23df-46ce-a797-821dcdb407b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubef56b15-50a0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A899%2C%22height%22%3A196%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A75961%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1641%2C%22originHeight%22%3A357%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PACAEVAL2LCWINRATE(%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A265%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A-HARDWINRATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1327%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A185%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LDPO(TTE%3BTREF%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIMPOTTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRALMIST%22%2C%22x%22%3A775%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GO81LOG%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A95%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220GT0(G3%22%2C%22x%22%3A206%2C%22y%22%3A267%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EF(GWR%22%2C%22x%22%3A231%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASE7BILNSTRUCT7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A749%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A176%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DP%22%2C%22x%22%3A1185%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REF(GL3%22%2C%22x%22%3A445%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E(G3%22%2C%22x%22%3A226%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220(G1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A447%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B7%A5SIMPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A734%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNSTRUCTBB%22%2C%22x%22%3A1516%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ASE7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1237%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASE8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A944%2C%22y%22%3A311%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNSTRUCT8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A1024%2C%22y%22%3A311%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SIMP0%22%2C%22x%22%3A1217%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INSTRUCT7B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1311%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DP0%22%2C%22x%22%3A734%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A942%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B3.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A973%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISTRAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1236%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1393%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1517%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLAMA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1037%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGO%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISTRAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1321%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B5.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A854%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B4.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1060%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210G0(G)%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A421%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B1.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A1556%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B1OG%22%2C%22x%22%3A369%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A183%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B7.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A1454%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASE8BL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1433%2C%22y%22%3A310%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebe9ed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uae4b61e4%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="lRS3j" id="lRS3j" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0eccfd6c" id="u0eccfd6c">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u3fde1afd" id="u3fde1afd"> 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐏𝐎: 𝐒𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u480cca3e" id="u480cca3e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd8f2b02" id="ufd8f2b02">DPO 是最广泛使用的偏好优化方法之一。DPO 无需学习显式的奖励模型，而是利用包含最优策略的闭式表达式，对奖励函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wYkM0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u98ceb55d" id="u98ceb55d">进行重参数化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf9f21af4" id="uf9f21af4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%2B%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%20Z(x).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49a6f412a891f18f8293593ff0d45eab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TL2Mu%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2f360020"><li fid="ua599fa7a" data-lake-id="u1d566a84" id="u1d566a84"><span data-lake-id="u212407ac" id="u212407ac">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ciqfo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f606f20" id="u5f606f20">为策略模型，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jQphK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9faaa47a" id="u9faaa47a">为参考策略，通常采用监督微调模型，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Z(x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1e77bac46833188a4177545f386f8565.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j7qDc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued5a7948" id="ued5a7948">为配分函数。将这一奖励形式代入 Bradley–Terry（BT）排序目标，即 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(y_w%5C%5Csucc%20y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Csigma(r(x%2Cy_w)-r(x%2Cy_l))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd086faf220ad1c257e8ca901451d06b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x43cL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f89736b" id="u9f89736b">，DPO 便可通过策略模型而非奖励模型来表示偏好数据的概率，从而得到以下优化目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5a59b0f0" id="u5a59b0f0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%3D-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D-%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67dd5b05039d6642f69f1d00ca42925a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GWQXF%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8f8fcf9f"><li fid="u912b5575" data-lake-id="ueb768463" id="ueb768463"><span data-lake-id="u632bfdc7" id="u632bfdc7">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac14c2d9bdedbcd69cf8d8827a1cf21d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MJq40%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf348f1a1" id="uf348f1a1">表示偏好数据集</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5903f53f4f8c62f99df77e4e3ccbc4e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AAeZv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4817c33a" id="u4817c33a">中的成对偏好样本，由提示、偏好回答和非偏好回答构成</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3f3498c8" id="u3f3498c8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b4a26ad" id="u2b4a26ad" style="color: #AD1A2B">隐式奖励存在以下不足：训练过程中需要参考模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff73154893f2557c1227ee196e79412a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZrX8q%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7bb70e1c" id="u7bb70e1c" style="color: #AD1A2B">，从而引入额外的内存开销和计算成本；训练阶段所优化的奖励与推理阶段所优化的对数似然并不一致，而推理阶段并不涉及参考模型</span></strong></p><ul list="u8a553f54"><li fid="u4e624f84" data-lake-id="uaa93117d" id="uaa93117d"><span data-lake-id="ubf881c09" id="ubf881c09">在 DPO 中，对于任意三元组</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(x%2Cy_w%2Cy_l)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fac14c2d9bdedbcd69cf8d8827a1cf21d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wRQ4c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0abd3635" id="u0abd3635">，满足奖励排序</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r(x%2Cy_w)%3Er(x%2Cy_l)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F095c36308fd232421894b0514129127b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oRCKB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a922459" id="u9a922459">，并不必然意味着满足似然排序</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(y_w%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3Ep_%5C%5Ctheta(y_l%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F20733804c4d58151549a92273f3f618f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D9gqm%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub966874a" id="ub966874a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u581f669f" id="u581f669f">长度归一化的奖励形式：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua81ad4f5" id="ua81ad4f5">一种解决方案是将所有 token 的对数概率之和作为奖励，但这种方式存在长度偏置</span></p><ul list="uaf10419e"><li fid="u3b7601a9" data-lake-id="uf7370447" id="uf7370447"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub03172ea" id="ub03172ea" style="color: #5C0036">较长的序列往往具有更低的对数概率。当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d3748a1a6b1a91dda986e0b204471a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pH8xV%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb7e7831" id="ucb7e7831" style="color: #5C0036">比</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5940c70497dd7c00369aa6f50b3cc63b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IfY2C%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe0fdb05" id="ufe0fdb05" style="color: #5C0036">更长时，将对数概率之和作为奖励进行优化，会迫使模型人为抬高较长序列的概率，以确保</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d3748a1a6b1a91dda986e0b204471a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s8V6e%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua263f120" id="ua263f120" style="color: #5C0036">获得高于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5940c70497dd7c00369aa6f50b3cc63b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ceCEP%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3175a210" id="u3175a210" style="color: #5C0036">的奖励。这种过度补偿会增加生成退化的风险。为解决这一问题，考虑将平均对数似然作为隐式奖励</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3369866f" id="u3369866f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7B%3Ci%7D).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e0a06c278bc380dee5a07649493cc77.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wBweD%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u6e77ced0"><li fid="uaaddcf62" data-lake-id="u6840ad8e" id="u6840ad8e"><span data-lake-id="u8b23a0be" id="u8b23a0be">这一指标通常用于对束搜索中的候选序列以及语言模型多项选择任务中的候选选项进行排序。考虑使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f3f197b904ccc8bce421a3124813852.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22an5Rb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e3c537b" id="u2e3c537b">替代 DPO 的奖励形式，使其与指导生成过程的似然指标保持一致，由此得到经过长度归一化的奖励</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4089786b" id="u4089786b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSimPO%7D%7D(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7B%3Ci%7D).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8822208ff18496ce3f25ac957aaf273d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kceg6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud29c7fb1"><li fid="u04e71b18" data-lake-id="u0b93999c" id="u0b93999c"><span data-lake-id="u6b7a23c7" id="u6b7a23c7">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yc7VQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f57e0f1" id="u6f57e0f1">是控制奖励差值缩放幅度的常数。按照回答长度对奖励进行归一化至关重要：从奖励形式中移除长度归一化项，会导致模型倾向于生成更长但质量更低的序列。这一奖励形式无需参考模型，因此相较于依赖参考模型的算法，具有更高的内存使用效率和计算效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud19739de" id="ud19739de" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790748864637-0196fceb-9409-41a7-8156-d5d518c06cd2.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucc8e7a06-8477-402d-8ef9-d557466a0c4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9ca50be6-43ae-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A643.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A342%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A271382%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1147%2C%22originHeight%22%3A610%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOGA(BLOGE(YWR)-BLOGTO(9W)-%E5%85%A5LOGTE(G2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A189%2C%22y%22%3A278%2C%22width%22%3A548%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%A50(810GEU-ZER%E5%8D%81%E5%85%A510(ZRE-810GE%22%2C%22x%22%3A179%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A511%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHEREZRER%3DE(AN)~D%5BBKL(TE(G2)TREF(GW))%22%2C%22x%22%3A172%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A470%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHEREPE(R)%3DEXP(%E7%82%B9LOG%E5%85%83E(GA)%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A369%2C%22height%22%3A